            "contentId": "Loop2_1_Stewardess_node_5_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh, I don’t know, ma’am. It’s just that our glorious chief attendant suddenly ordered me to stand here on standby. I’m not allowed to leave until she gets back to me.",
                "zh": "我也不知道呢这位女士。只是我们尊敬的乘务长大人，忽然莫名奇妙的要求我站在这里待命，在她回复我之前绝对不能离开岗位而已呢。",
