            "contentId": "Loop2_1_StewardessGetFood_node_22_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Miss, I’m not from Yuntai. I don’t really know anything about that. I just work on the plane.",
                "zh": "女士，我不是芸台人，也并不了解这些事。我只是在飞机上工作而已。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -352.79998779296877,
            "positionY": 1656.800048828125,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "215f9d44-9703-43c9-834a-0a79f96750ae",
            "index": 23,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_StewardessGetFood_node_23_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Have you seen anyone suspicious onboard lately?",
                "zh": "您近来有在飞机上见过类似的可疑人士吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -16.799999237060548,
            "positionY": 1656.800048828125,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e779a903-abf5-4623-907a-962c97ea6f06",
            "index": 24,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_StewardessGetFood_node_24_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Of course. That weird girl in the back wearing a Taoist robe looks pretty suspicious, doesn’t she?",
                "zh": "当然有了，后面机舱那位穿着奇怪道袍的小姐不就很可疑吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 326.4000244140625,
            "positionY": 1656.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "88eba7eb-7208-4753-94a6-17ac2da061a3",
            "index": 25,
            "characterId": "ed1baf90-69f0-402f-959a-2683ad667ded",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_StewardessGetFood_node_25_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "(She does look kind of suspicious...)",
                "zh": "（她看起来确实挺可疑的。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 693.6000366210938,
            "positionY": 1656.800048828125,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d088ebd4-f369-4e71-8a9e-51d3001aaa44",
            "index": 26,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_StewardessGetFood_node_26_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "But as long as they don’t cause trouble, it’s not our place to intervene. We’re service crew, not judges.",
                "zh": "但只要没有造成危害就没有介入的需要，我们毕竟是服务人员，不能以貌取人。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1033.5999755859375,
            "positionY": 1648.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "870607a5-5bd4-4c18-8cba-d96511c2431a",
