            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_StewardessGetFood_node_32_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ugh, same thing every year. Last year, my assigned crew flew out before the lockdown.",
                "zh": "唉~每年都会这样，我去年待的机组在封城前返回了。",
                "ja": ""
