            "contentId": "Loop2_1_StewardessGetFood_node_33_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "(She says that, but her smile looks more genuine than ever. She must be happy to get some time off.)",
                "zh": "（她虽然这么说，但脸上的笑容却前所未有的真诚，她应该很高兴能休假吧。）",
