            "content": {
                "en": "This time, I just happened to be on the unlucky shift. Once we land, the whole crew will probably be stuck waiting it out.",
                "zh": "而今年排到的这班飞机正好赶在芸台封城的时候，落地后我们整个机组大概只能暂时休整等待了，真是倒霉~",
